", "pk": 8, "fields": {"name": "Everest Base Camp Trek", "description": "Followed glacier valleys and Sherpa villages beneath towering Himalayan peaks. Thin air and long climbing days made acclimatisation essential.", "date": "2026-10-11", "max_hikers": 10, "route": 8, "owner": 10, "hikers": [1, 2, 10, 11, 12, 17, 18, 19]}}, {"model": "tracker.hike", "pk": 9, "fields": {"name": "Tour du Mont Blanc", "description": "A long Alpine traverse with steep passes, exposed paths and constantly changing weather. Every day brought another climb and a new valley.", "date": "2026-09-07", "max_hikers": 10, "route": 9, "owner": 13, "hikers": [3, 4, 5, 6, 13, 14, 15, 16]}}, {"model": "tracker.hike", "pk": 10, "fields": {"name": "Inca Trail to Machu Picchu", "description": "Ancient stone paths climbed through cloud forest and high mountain passes before reaching the legendary Inca citadel.", "date": "2026-08-14", "max_hikers": 10, "route": 10, "owner": 6, "hikers": [2, 4, 6, 7, 8, 9, 17]}}, {"model": "tracker.hike", "pk": 11, "fields": {"name": "Torres del Paine O Circuit", "description": "Remote trails crossed windswept valleys, glaciers and rugged mountain passes. Strong Patagonian winds made exposed sections especially challenging.", "date": "2026-03-23", "max_hikers": 10, "route": 11, "owner": 7, "hikers": [1, 3, 7, 10, 11, 12, 18, 19]}}, {"model": "tracker.hike", "pk": 12, "fields": {"name": "Annapurna Circuit via Thorong La", "description": "A high-altitude journey through dry mountain valleys, traditional villages and snowy terrain near the 5,416 m Thorong La Pass.", "date": "2026-10-04", "max_hikers": 10, "route": 12, "owner": 9, "hikers": [4, 5, 9, 11, 13, 14, 15, 16]}}, {"model": "tracker.hike", "pk": 13, "fields": {"name": "GR20 Northern Traverse", "description": "Jagged granite ridges, steep scrambles and rocky descents turned this demanding long-distance trail into a serious test of endurance.", "date": "2026-06-16", "max_hikers": 10, "route": 13, "owner": 12, "hikers":